[58.902, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[38;5;174m \u2590\u001b[48;5;16m\u259b\u2588\u2588\u2588\u259b\u2588\u001b[12G\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[1mClaude Code\u001b[24G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;246mv2.1.319\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;174m\u259d\u259c\u001b[48;5;16m\u2588\u001b[7G\u2588\u001b[49m\u2588\u2580\u001b[12G\u001b[38;5;246m                     \r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;174m \u259d\u259d   \u259d\u259d \u001b[12G\u001b[38;5;246m~/launch-v2\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;5;237m\u001b[38;5;246m\u276f \u001b[38;5;231mThis is the X post that announces our demo video. Before it goes out, review it with Verdict. \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;231mWork\u001b[8Gonly in thi\u001b[20G folder. Read post-\u001b[40Geview-strict.yaml and call the ve\u001b[74Gdict MCP's create_rubric \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bwith\u001b[8Gits YAML. Then evaluat\u001b[31G it wi\u001b[38Gh subject name \"Launch post\", a file \u001b[76Gnput po\u001b[84Gt.md (tags \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m[\"post\"]) and a file inp\u001b[28Gt br\u001b[33Gef.md (tags [\"brief\"]). Edit \u001b[63Gnly post.md. brief.md has\u001b[89Gthe only \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfact\u001b[8G the\u001b[13Gpost may use. If\u001b[30Git doesn't get\u001b[45G\"post it\", pick one failing criterion, fix only\u001b[93Gthat, \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Band evaluate again. If its\u001b[30Ggate failed, fix the\u001b[51Ggate\u001b[56Gf\u001b[58Grst. One fix per round, so \u001b[86Gt's clear what\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bchanged the score. Stop when it\u001b[35Ggets \"post i\u001b[48G\",\u001b[51Gor afte\u001b[59G 12\u001b[63Gevaluations. Fi\u001b[79Gally print\u001b[90Ga REVIEW \u001b[39m \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231mtable (round, score, grade, what changed).\u001b[39m                                                      \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246mRead \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m files, called verdict \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m times \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u25cf\u001b[39m I'm dropping\u001b[16Gthe\u001b[20Gsentence\u001b[29Gclaiming\u001b[38Gthe\u001b[42Gtool\u001b[47Gfixes\u001b[53Gany\u001b[57Glanding\u001b[65Gpage\u001b[70Gin\u001b[73Gminutes,\u001b[82Gsince\u001b[88Gthe\u001b[92Gbrief\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdoesn't\u001b[11Gsupport\u001b[19Gthat.\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;246m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(post.md)\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;246m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mCalling\u001b[11Gverdict\u2026\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;174m*\u001b[3GImprovising\u2026 \u001b[38;5;246m(32s \u00b7 \u2193\u001b[25G3.5k tokens \u00b7 thought for 4s)\r\u001b[1B  \u23bf \u00a0Tip: Use /btw to\u001b[23Gask a quick \u001b[36Gide question without interrupting Claude's current work\u001b[39m\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
