[104.434, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;114m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(post.md)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m  \u23bf \u00a0\u001b[39mAdded\u001b[12G\u001b[1m1\u001b[14G\u001b[22mline,\u001b[20Gremoved\u001b[28G\u001b[1m1\u001b[30G\u001b[22mline\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 2 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 3 \u001b[22m Claude Code took an AI one-shot landing page for Tideline (a fictional product) and \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m   \u001b[22m rebuilt it one check at a time, scored by Verdict, an evaluation engine that scores \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m   \u001b[22m work against a rubric.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m4\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m 5 -\u001b[38;5;231mThe scores: 0 \u2192 10 \u2192 20 \u2192 23 \u2192 33 \u2192 34 \u2192 49 \u2192 58 \u2192 71 \u2192 93, in about 8 minutes, unat\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;167m   -\u001b[38;5;231mtended.                                                                             \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 5 +\u001b[38;5;231mThe scores: 0 \u2192 10 \u2192 20 \u2192 23 \u2192 33 \u2192 34 \u2192 49 \u2192 58 \u2192 71 \u2192 93, in about 8 minutes, unat\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m   +\u001b[38;5;231mtended.\u001b[48;5;28m Two rounds barely moved because the fix was partial.\u001b[48;5;22m                        \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[2m 6 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 7 \u001b[22m #DevTools #buildinpublic\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246mCalled verdict \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39mNext fix: end on a question readers\u001b[39Gcan\u001b[43Ganswer\u001b[50Gfrom\u001b[55Gtheir\u001b[61Gown\u001b[65Gw